clockwork[0] | 6, 6, 32, 32 | Part 1 of 3 of the strip behind the clock in the top panel. The strip scrolls as game time passes, with the first part wrapping round. It and the seasons are drawn brighter while the mouse is over the clock.
clockwork[1] | 38, 6, 32, 32 | Part 2 of 3 of the strip behind the clock in the top panel. The strip scrolls as game time passes, with the first part wrapping round. It and the seasons are drawn brighter while the mouse is over the clock.
clockwork[2] | 70, 6, 32, 32 | Part 3 of 3 of the strip behind the clock in the top panel. The strip scrolls as game time passes, with the first part wrapping round. It and the seasons are drawn brighter while the mouse is over the clock.
background | 114, 6, 192, 64 | The background behind the clock and the speed buttons, drawn as one image. The battle view leaves it out.
